[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 14162.87, "timestamp": "03:56:02", "text": "ただひたすら一人で、死ぬほど働き続ける。だから私は"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14165.59, "timestamp": "03:56:05", "text": "1位に賛成します"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14168.83, "timestamp": "03:56:08", "text": "2番目や3番目ではなく、同意する。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14172.309, "timestamp": "03:56:12", "text": "新しいものかテストされていないものか、おい"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14175.349, "timestamp": "03:56:15", "text": "同意する。私は通常新しいものを試してみたい"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14178.309, "timestamp": "03:56:18", "text": "誰も試していないこと。それで"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14180.229, "timestamp": "03:56:20", "text": "それはそれはそれはそれはそれは"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14182.63, "timestamp": "03:56:22", "text": "率直に言って、あなたは敏感です"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14184.269, "timestamp": "03:56:24", "text": "完全に"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14186.469, "timestamp": "03:56:26", "text": "正直に話そう。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14189.75, "timestamp": "03:56:29", "text": "それはそういう感情の論理だ"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14192.389, "timestamp": "03:56:32", "text": "私の心を弄ぶようなやつ。ああ、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14194.75, "timestamp": "03:56:34", "text": "神様、なぜ私は"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14197.75, "timestamp": "03:56:37", "text": "プレス？ M、問題は私がそうするだろうということだ"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 14197.931, "timestamp": "03:56:37", "author": "@Her_escapes", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/k5qSeiW9HuWS-yTlvFtkJFgjFQNzT4clVmOKs1PPP76ezfBidoUedboWgIi3wJy0ffSGpxX2Gy8=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "agree"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14199.51, "timestamp": "03:56:39", "text": "1番目にこれに賛成します。なぜなら私は"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14202.389, "timestamp": "03:56:42", "text": "まず敏感になってから私は"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 14205.023, "timestamp": "03:56:45", "author": "@DinyoFoxy", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/DGXvUKi0q0ld5Zo5CNG2tmulZfZqg_h6ivQHLtQfKyx-z_EjHr-Bx7limqyg4JtpZ00_XP_BTQ=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "hey man"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14205.75, "timestamp": "03:56:45", "text": "正直に言うと、また同じことが私にも当てはまります。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14208.11, "timestamp": "03:56:48", "text": "彼らにスペースを与える"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 14208.58, "timestamp": "03:56:48", "author": "@KonztellionHelper", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/GocLQxiJeUhcpFBwOECdYbCqbqHlCvz1B8j2gnfHQ1Q3AM1kFQ-eKqoi6TpMpyuxId3-6U94bcI=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "Greetings Konzteller! JeRRy_PlayzZz~🌟 Welcome to the Guild! Make sure to read the Guildmate Guidelines in the description below before chatting further. Enjoy your stay!"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14211.59, "timestamp": "03:56:51", "text": "感情だが、もしそれがあまりにもひどくなってきたら"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14214.55, "timestamp": "03:56:54", "text": "彼らは自分自身のために乗り越えている、あるいは"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14216.79, "timestamp": "03:56:56", "text": "自分自身のために私は行く"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14218.95, "timestamp": "03:56:58", "text": "正直に言うと、おい、聞いてくれ"}]